      "§rA quieter sound that immediately rips §1me§r out of §1my§r panic attack.\n\n\nA clattering of plastic on wood. \n\n§0Lifting §1myself§r up from §1my§r fetal position, §1my§r eyes become fixed on a position right in front of §1me§r.",
