      "front of it. \n\nThe background darkens hastily to adjust to the new, most violent heat source it can see; §5my§0 digits glow bright white on the camera’s LCD. \n\n§5I§0 am not any more confident in §5my§0 ability to face whatever the hell is down there, but",
