      "any finer details. \n\nNothing grants §5me§0 the excuse to run and hide. \n\n§5I§0 need to know where the hell §5I§0 am, and §5I§0 need to find a way out. \n\n§5I§0 trek down the stairs, one step at a time. A revolting ",
      "sensation of disgust strikes §5my§0 soul as §5I§0 set foot on the second to last step, and meet the sound of squishing. \n\nThe carpet on these steps is utterly soaked. \n\nWhat the fuck? Why is this flooring so wet?",
      "Has this place been flooded or something?\n\n§5I§0 can’t see how that would be possible, given the…\n\ncircumstances \n\nof this place. \n\nThe soggy carpet cares little for what §5I §0consider impossible.",
      "No matter how hard §5I§0 try to not believe it, the carpet is wet. \n\nThe last two steps are soaking wet. \n\nBut the floor \nis not wet. \n\nNo, that is a bit misleading. \n\nIt would be more",
