      "into §5my§0 shoe and through §5my§0 sock. \n\nFucking awesome. \n\nFlooding across the entire lower level of wherever this place is. \n\nAt least 6 inches of water seems to cover the entire floor. \n",
      "§5I§0 realize now that the air is extremely humid. \n§5I§0 am filled with a deep sense of dread. \n\nThe air seems to carry a sickly sense of rot that would come with long standing stagnant water.\n\nWhatever has happened here, it’s",
      "been like this for a long time. \n\nThis is fucking disgusting. \n\n§5I§0 turn the camera down to §5my§0 feet. \n\nIt shows them abruptly disappearing in a dark gray wall that seems to ripple across its surface.",
      "The ripples grow faint quickly, becoming nearly imperceivable after just a few feet, but the fact that they don't stop abruptly tells §5me§0 that this entire place is like this. \n\nWell, §5I’m§0 already one foot in. Might as well keep going. §5My§0 second foot makes a much",
