      "§5I§r don’t like this at all.\n\nTurning §5my§r head back to face the ascent doesn’t make this feeling go away. \n§5I§r feel so trapped between these veils. \n\nContinuing up at least feels a bit easier, seeing as §5I’ve§r already begun the climb.",
