      "§5I’ve§r depleted all of §5my§r stamina, and the ability to be fearful of whatever set §5me§r off in the first place. \n\n§5I§r need to stop. \n§5I§r have to. \n§5I§r don’t care \nwhat’s coming for §5me§r. Let it come. \n\n\nBut nothing comes.",
